{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1463524-angelic-familiar-mage-demon","id":1463524,"title":"Angelic Familiar (Mage/Demon)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-10-11T19:48:33-07:00","id":1463524,"title":"Angelic Familiar (Mage/Demon)","content":"So this doesn't actually work by Demon or Mage's lore, but I love the concept of Angelic Familiars, I so I find found a rationale that I like for my Chronicle. If anyone has other ideas for angelic familiars, feel free to post them! <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><br /> </span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>The Black Cat</b><br /> </span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Angels can\u2019t become Familiars, for the God-Machine is their only master. No Mage can force Angels to act against their will and even if they could, an angel severed from its God would immediately Fall and cease to be an ephemeral entity. Except angelic Familiars do exist, for one reason.<br /> </span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">It is their God-given Mission.<br /> </span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">The Black Cat is such an angel. When the God-Machine identifies a Mage likely to bond with a strange entity, it deploys the Cat, instructing it to encourage the bond and aid the Willworker in all regards. After establishing the connection, any additional parameters the God-Machine feeds into the angel\u2019s processors entangle themselves in the Mage\u2019s Obsessions. These manifest as prophetic dreams, irresistible urges, and uncontrollable drives, but the God-Machine is utterly indifferent to the specifics. All it cares about is that the Black Cat acts as a conduit to a powerful and driven pawn in its grand design.<br /> </span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">While perched on its master\u2019s lap, the Black Cat looks for all the world to be a regular feline \u2014 until it moves. It seems to stutter its way through reality, flickering in and out like a lousy hologram. It\u2019s belly isn\u2019t complete either; in its place is a metallic rib cage, blinking lights, and wires hanging like entrails.<br /> </span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><b><i>The Black Cat</i></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><b>Virtue:</b> Vengeful</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><b>Vice:</b> Loyal</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><b>Rank: </b>1</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><b>Attributes: </b>Power 1, Finesse 3, Resistance 4</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><b>Influence: </b>Cats 1</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><b>Corpus: </b>6</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><b>Willpower: </b>7</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><b>Size: </b>2</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><b>Speed:</b> 9 (species factor 5)</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><b>Defense: </b>3</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><b>Initiative:</b> +7</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><b>Armor:</b> 0</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><b>Numina:</b> Angelic Familiar, Blast</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><b>Manifestation: </b>Discorporiation, Materialize, Twilight Form</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><b>Max Essence: </b>10</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><b>Ban: </b>Must hiss at any Mage or shapeshifter other than its master.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><b>Bane:</b> Flames taken from a bonfire.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><br /> <i>New Numen - Angelic Familiar: </i>The God-Machine has commanded the angel to serve as a Mage\u2019s familiar, allowing the willworker to establish a bond to them without the angel Falling. By spending 5 Essence, the angel may impose the Mystery Commands Condition on its master, communicating a mission from the God-Machine. This condition ends without resolving when the Obsession granted by it is fulfilled.</span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-23T03:25:39-07:00","id":1464987,"title":"","content":"I thought being a familiar was represented as a Manifestation, not a numen.<br /> <br /> That said, I'd love to see an Exile (semi-fallen/ignored/lost Angel) stuck trying to figure out what it has to get it's attached Mage to do...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-23T08:54:55-07:00","id":1465015,"title":"","content":"You are correct, but in my mind what's happening is the Numen acts as permission for the angel to even gain the Manifestation in the first place. Normally, angels can't become familiar because two things happen when a Mages casts Familiar on them: the Mage Clashes against the GM and forces the angel to obey their commands instead of its. For the former, the Mage will lose the Clash against the God-Machine and then for the later, the angel would immediately fall and become a Demon. So there's about two or three layers of &quot;this won't work&quot; since Mages can't create player splats without Archmastery and can't complete with the GM. <br /> <br /> This Numen basically bypasses all of that, laying out that obeying a Mage's will is the GM plan for the angle, so there is no clash nor does the fall take place. <br /> <br /> An Exile familiar is a great idea! I hadn't thought of that before, but I am definitely stealing it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-23T18:58:39-07:00","id":1465080,"title":"","content":"I was reasonably sure you could trade Numen for Manifestations anyway and the G-d Machine build Angels to purpose, so permission seems unneeded. Otherwise the Clash of Wills thing you mentioned would happen. If the Machine gives an Angel the Familiar manifestation, then the Angel is allowed to be a Familiar according to &quot;the Plan&quot;. But it is your table and your rules. Just sharing my thoughts on the matter. Ultimately there isn't much of a difference, more just some confusion on my part as to why it appears on tge &quot;wrong&quot; line on the stat sheet.<br /> Sorry for the inconvenience or any rudeness.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-23T19:14:30-07:00","id":1465083,"title":"","content":"As FallenEco stated, simply having the Manifestation is enough if &quot;obey Mage&quot; is already its Mission. Still, the Numina has a place in allowing the G-M to insert Its own commands into the Mage via Mystery Commands Conditions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-23T22:01:24-07:00","id":1465095,"title":"","content":"*Shrugs*<br /> It ain't a bother. I'm just going off what Dave's said about Mage/Demon interactions. But yes, that is also why I put the Mystery commands bit in there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-11T06:54:49-08:00","id":1467439,"title":"","content":"With how seers and the GM have canonically cooperated at some points I can definitely see this being a thing that could happen. Especially with the fact that a familiar may break the bond and isn't enslaved by it.<br /> <br /> <br /> I agree though that it wouldn't need a numen to allow the bond but rather like a ghost familiar uses death instead of spirit maybe an angelic version of the spell uses fate + prime, in line with the players guide to contagion.<br /> <br /> With how being a familiar protects against essance bleed and not just while in the presence of the mage and how the mage can provide essance to the angel through the bond I can definitely see it benefiting the angel enough that it could be a valid route a mission could take.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}